# ChkTeX configuration for this LaTeX project
# See `chktex --help` or the ChkTeX manual for details.

# Suppress warnings:
#  1  - Command terminated with space (common with macros like \onehalfspacing)
#  3  - Enclose previous parenthesis with {} (false positives with \left/\right)
# 27  - Could not execute LaTeX command (input files resolved at build time)
# 35  - Should use \min/\max (false positive on subscript names like C_{max})
# 36  - Mathmode on at end of line (common in multi-line equations)
# 44  - User regex style opinions (vertical rules, \hline in tables)
CmdLine {
    -n1 -n3 -n27 -n35 -n36 -n44
}
